  "description": "Abstract Communication Service Interface (IEC 61850-7-2) mapped onto MMS per 61850-8-1: GetDataValues/SetDataValues, GetDataDirectory, Report (BRCB/URCB with full state machine -- ConfRev, SqNum, EntryID, TimeOfEntry, BufOvfl, PurgeBuf, BufTm, IntgPd, GI, segmentation, reconnect/resync), Control (ctlModel, ctlNum, origin, Test, Check, interlock/synchrocheck, operate timeout, cancel, command termination, AddCause), dataset lifecycle (static/dynamic, ownership, persistence, limits, association cleanup), sandboxed File Transfer (path normalization, traversal prevention, quotas, concurrent/partial-transfer cleanup), and clock/timestamp semantics (UTC encoding, leap-second flag, clock-not-synchronized/accuracy bits, deterministic simulated time -- actual clock sync is an external SNTP/PTP concern, this module only consumes/exposes time quality). Also owns crash/restart persistence for report EntryIDs and dataset state (distinct from association reconnect)  see docs/roadmap.md Phase 7.",
  "id": "Iec61850.Acsi",
